      brief: 'DISPATCH » The market\'s router-on-a-stick cable chokes every Saturday. Vee Lan wants the new switch to route between the VLANs and the router kept for the way out.\n\nCLIENT (Vee Lan) » "Gateways off the router and onto the switch, a routed /30 up to the router, and nothing in between that I have to explain to Hanna."',
